scatter), BLOCK_S=8, num_warps=4, num_stages=2, fp32 internal, halves-paired RoPE, V verbatim, int64 cache offsets. Establish green + baseline geomean (H1 fusion win).\", \"change_vs_parent\": \"initial baseline\", \"config\": {\"kernels\": 2, \"block_s\": 8, \"num_warps\": 4, \"num_stages\": 2, \"autotune\": false}, \"static_checks\": {\"rms_fp32\": true, \"rope_halves_paired\": true, \"v_verbatim\": true, \"int64_cache_offset\": true, \"masks_ok\": true, \"no_fallback\": true}, \"validation\": {\"stage\": \"feedback\", \"all_pass\": true, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"6a214883\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 1024, \"cache_len\": 512, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 15.16291964080129, \"ref_ms\": 0.823157, \"cand_ms\": 0.0542875, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 3.7706165313720703}, {\"uuid\": \"13f5b933\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 541, \"cache_len\": 0, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 14.464385742504204, \"ref_ms\": 0.49061750000000004, \"cand_ms\": 0.033919, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 2.98541522026062}, {\"uuid\": \"2ff5eaf3\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 1, \"cache_len\": 0, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 17.27447961220416, \"ref_ms\": 0.151454, \"cand_ms\": 0.0087675, \"max_abs\": 0.0, \"max_rel\": 0.0}, {\"uuid\": \"052e17c9\", \"B\": 2, \"S\": 512, \"cache_len\": 256, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 15.276255078218348, \"ref_ms\": 0.831013, \"cand_ms\": 0.054399, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 3.523393154144287}, {\"uuid\": \"39eb0040\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 2048, \"cache_len\": 0, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 14.891537029312117, \"ref_ms\": 1.4636445, \"cand_ms\": 0.098287, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 5.349551677703857}]}, \"geomean_speedup\": 15.384693405560622, \"decision\": \"new-best\", \"decision_reason\": \"all 5 workloads pass; baseline established at 15.38x geomean; H1 (fusion win) confirmed\", \"cumulative_evaluations\": 1, \"skill_usage\": \"none (KernelWiki is SM90/SM100-only; task is sm_80 Ampere)\", \"notes\": \"max_rel large but per-element max_atol=0.0625 within tol; evaluator uses matched-ratio 0.99. W3 exact (angle=0 -> identity RoPE).\"}\n{\"candidate_id\": \"c002\", \"parent\": \"c001\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-17T00:10:00Z\", \"source_file\": \"solution/solution.py\", \"source_sha256\": \"7ab237ac231e98239efb64238465fe3f8ca1c0e3eac3a05e4b08413dd4fd70da\", \"hypothesis\": \"H2: @triton.autotune over BLOCK_S in {1,2,4,8,16,32} x num_warps in {1,2,4}, keyed on S, lets each regime (decode S=1 .. prefill S=2048) pick a better block/warp config than the fixed c001 (BLOCK_S=8, num_warps=4). Expect geomean up vs c001.\", \"change_vs_parent\": \"single lever: added @triton.autotune (num_stages=1); math/layout/invariants identical to c001\", \"config\": {\"kernels\": 2, \"autotune\": true, \"block_s_space\": [1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32], \"num_warps_space\": [1, 2, 4], \"num_stages\": 1, \"key\": [\"S\"]}, \"static_checks\": {\"rms_fp32\": true, \"rope_halves_paired\": true, \"v_verbatim\": true, \"int64_cache_offset\": true, \"masks_ok\": true, \"no_fallback\": true}, \"validation\": {\"stage\": \"feedback\", \"all_pass\": true, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"6a214883\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 1024, \"cache_len\": 512, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 14.886644362058053, \"ref_ms\": 0.823157, \"cand_ms\": 0.055295, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 3.7706165313720703}, {\"uuid\": \"13f5b933\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 541, \"cache_len\": 0, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 14.423139111006588, \"ref_ms\": 0.49061750000000004, \"cand_ms\": 0.034016, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 2.98541522026062}, {\"uuid\": \"2ff5eaf3\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 1, \"cache_len\": 0, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 17.726357677902623, \"ref_ms\": 0.151454, \"cand_ms\": 0.008544, \"max_abs\": 0.0, \"max_rel\": 0.0}, {\"uuid\": \"052e17c9\", \"B\": 2, \"S\": 512, \"cache_len\": 256, \"pass\": true, \"speedup\": 14.886436715720082, \"ref_ms\": 0.831013, \"cand_ms\": 0.0558235, \"max_abs\": 0.0625, \"max_rel\": 3.523393154144287}, {\"uuid\": \"39eb0040\", \"B\": 1, \"S\": 2048, \"cache_len\"